@osuki-dev/skia-diagrams 0.1.6: allow the host to supply toolbar glyphs.
The bundled viewer uses font characters for close, fit, copy-source and success.
Muqun supplies its existing themed Lucide icons without changing button layout,
accessibility labels, callbacks, zoom values, format labels or auto-hide behavior.
The dependency stays independent of the host icon library and old callers keep
its original glyphs. Source, JavaScript and declarations expose the same API.
Remove when an upstream release exposes equivalent toolbar icon customization.

